d perimeter management. Long Distance Target Coverage Weatherproof IP66 Certified Shell Enhanced Night Vision Infrared Range Highly Visible Deterrent to Potential Thieves PTZ Camera Advanced Pan, Tilt & Zoom automation built for dynamic perimeter coverage. Suitable For: Industrial Factories Large Parking Areas Commercial Warehouses School Compound Premises Full 360° Motorized Rotation Powerful Optical Hardware Zoom Intelligent Motion Auto Tracking AI Wireless WiFi Smart Camera Best plug-and-play modern choice for small spaces and apartments. Fast DIY Cable-free Installation Instant Mobile App Monitoring Real-time Two-way Audio Communication Smart Human Motion Detection Alert Push Important Technical Features When buying any modern CCTV cameras, always double check these exact configurations: Full HD 1080p or 4K Resolution Scale Color Night Vision Hardware Support Local SD Card & Secure Cloud Recording Engine Robust Weatherproof IP66/IP67 Waterproofing Storage Architecture Mapping Understanding your recording framework changes your long-term maintenance costs. DVR System Traditional wired analog configuration best for single-property standard coverage setups. NVR System Modern high-speed network-based recording architecture tailored for digital IP cameras. Cloud Storage Backup Highly secure, tamper-proof secondary backup that keeps files safe even if hardware is damaged. Which Setup Metric Should You Buy? Here is our standard architectural scale recommendation for absolute safety coverage: 1 BHK Home 2-3 BHK Home Premium Villa 6-8 Cameras Needed Small Enterprise Office 8-16 Cameras Needed Industrial Warehouse 16+ Cameras Needed Professional Installation Tips Always install primary security cameras at the main entrance points. Cover secondary exit pathways and peripheral parking lanes properly. Record continuous staircase entryways and backyard blind spots. Keep your primary physical DVR/NVR unit locked in a secure, hidden room. Ensure seamless backup connection with 